ward of new options makes for a truly engaging and rewarding gameplay loop.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558200/extras/9a54f80c28d5af6bad8e2a91d7d86eee.webp?t=1728657936\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558200/extras/d9e9bf025f7bc3f45992ca31c97f027d.poster.avif?t=1728657936\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558200/extras/d9e9bf025f7bc3f45992ca31c97f027d.webm?t=1728657936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558200/extras/d9e9bf025f7bc3f45992ca31c97f027d.mp4?t=1728657936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Master hundreds of skills and unlock powerful upgrades to craft your own unique build.  Experiment with different combinations and build your character to dominate the battlefield! Like Vampire Survivors, you'll have an endless array of upgrades and power-ups to choose from, but with more strategic depth and control.",
